{
	"title": "Building a business website: 10 best practices",
	"blocks": {
		"241cb5c1d9f3": [
			{
				"_key": "d07ad594b6940",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "In 2025, a business website is no longer "
			},
			{
				"_key": "3d73605cecd7",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "a luxury"
			},
			{
				"_key": "8bd7068c8fb9",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": ", but "
			},
			{
				"_key": "82933e8b9efe",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "a strategic necessity"
			},
			{
				"_key": "dfcab767f752",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": ". A well-designed online presence has become a fundamental pillar for growing your business, whatever your industry."
			}
		],
		"197616e9527a": [
			{
				"_key": "d5ade930cb3b",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "❓ "
			},
			{
				"_key": "1da1a7baee4e",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "Why invest in a professional website?"
			}
		],
		"575ccc545b6e": [
			{
				"_key": "7be197c1a5d30",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Build a strong, credible digital presence"
			}
		],
		"79b57884a6ba": [
			{
				"_key": "29a015beed110",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Strengthen your brand's professional image"
			}
		],
		"a9c6d8667e02": [
			{
				"_key": "99d641cfd8440",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Communicate effectively with your target audience"
			}
		],
		"3e0397ad5a6a": [
			{
				"_key": "dca1e9aacb470",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Generate business opportunities (84% of consumers look online before making any purchase)"
			}
		],
		"a4613bec9660": [
			{
				"_key": "a7b4ba5f3cc50",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "In this complete guide, I'll walk you through 10 essential practices for building a website that will take your business to new heights."
			}
		],
		"c5eb47860068": [
			{
				"_key": "b41282e58d5b",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "⚠️ "
			},
			{
				"_key": "ace439a14288",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "Note:"
			},
			{
				"_key": "45844e0b2573",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " This article doesn't go into technical details. It's meant as a guide for entrepreneurs."
			}
		],
		"677bf8bb659d": [
			{
				"_key": "3673dd9f3d080",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "#1. Get inspired"
			}
		],
		"375add60d600": [
			{
				"_key": "b10071bd52850",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "As with any creative work, inspiration is key. Start by visiting the websites of companies in your industry, "
			},
			{
				"_key": "3177d0f049dd",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "or your direct competitors"
			},
			{
				"_key": "80fe2539cdda",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": ": education, real estate, retail, leisure, communications, etc."
			}
		],
		"fd4039ed9541": [
			{
				"_key": "3f5d81a19b610",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "With over "
			},
			{
				"_key": "3f5d81a19b611",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"b3f97f4d90f2"
				],
				"text": "1.9 billion active websites"
			},
			{
				"_key": "3f5d81a19b612",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " in 2025, there's no shortage of examples and styles. The goal is to get a clear picture of the look and the message you want your site to convey."
			}
		],
		"3556cdf25391": [
			{
				"_key": "48fb69eafcde",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "🎯 This inspiration and analysis phase will help you develop a unique, impactful concept, making it easier to communicate with your web services provider to bring your vision to life."
			}
		],
		"c1c126ff00cd": [
			{
				"_key": "89278f2d2b070",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "#2. A good domain name and a reliable web host"
			}
		],
		"0643160627e6": [
			{
				"_key": "a3d6a5e2a3b40",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "##2.1 A good domain name"
			}
		],
		"53baec71affe": [
			{
				"_key": "075f244d34890",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Your domain name is the front door to your website. It should be memorable, easy to spell and, ideally, derived from your company name plus an extension."
			}
		],
		"4509928db6e0": [
			{
				"_key": "63b7ac73fe9c0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "The domain extension (TLD) indicates its category or country of origin:"
			}
		],
		"d84326b18177": [
			{
				"_key": "fdd076756c970",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
